16. Custom Reward/Penalty Systems
```
model.set_reward(fn(output, target) {
    let base = accuracy(output, target)
    let penalty = if output.length > 100 { -0.2 } else { 0 }
    let bonus = if uses_keyword(output, "efficient") { 0.1 } else { 0 }
    return base + penalty + bonus
})
```
Fully custom scoring, not limited to standard loss/accuracy — connects directly to self-play evaluators.
