31. Design Philosophy Check-In
The framework is not hardcoded — techniques, layers, bridges, optimizers, dashboards, and guardrails all route through the same open interface pattern (Section 3), so new capabilities (skills, self-play, multimodal) extend the system instead of requiring special-cased additions. This consistency — one pattern, applied everywhere — is what makes it "powerful by design" rather than just feature-rich.
Transformer clarification: Transformer is a built-in `Technique`, exactly like Regression, CNN, or MoE — not special-cased in the compiler:
```
let model = qai.build(technique: "transformer")
```
