65. Get/Set Method Discipline (Every Type)
A consistent rule across every Type: measured results are read-only; settings/dials are adjustable, before or during training.
```
model.loss()                          // GET — read-only, a measured outcome
model.accuracy()                      // GET — read-only

model.set_learning_rate(0.0005)       // SET — adjustable live, mid-training
model.set_target_epochs(50)           // SET — adjustable before or during training
model.pause_at_epoch(20)              // SET — a live control
model.setting_history("learning_rate")  // log of every mid-training adjustment made, with timestamps
```
This mirrors the parameters-vs-hyperparameters distinction (Section 43) applied consistently to every method, not just those two.
