98. CI/CD, Diagnostics & Community Tooling
CI/CD-style automated testing gate on model changes:
```
qai.pipeline_ci(model,
    on: "every_finetune" | "every_logic_change",
    run: [model.snapshot_as_tests(), model.stress_test(), model.check_endpoints()],
    block_deploy_if: "any_test_fails",
    bind_evidence_to: "config_hash",                    // eval results cryptographically tied to the exact config that produced them
    reject_if: "config_changed_but_evidence_stale"         // a changed training config with no recomputed eval gets refused outright, not silently trusted
)
```
Treats a model change like a code change — nothing ships until it passes the same checks every time, automatically. Binding evidence to a config hash means a fine-tuning gate can render automatically on review, and a stale evaluation can never be mistaken for a current one.
