104. Environment (VM) Configuration, Feedback & Two VM Tiers
Two distinct VM tiers, same underlying `Environment` interface (Section 34), different weight classes:
```
let sandbox = qai.connect_vm(type: "code_sandbox", language: "python")                       // lightweight, fast, narrow
let full_vm = qai.connect_vm(type: "full_container", os: "ubuntu", allow_network: true)         // a real general-purpose computer
full_vm.install_package("numpy")   full_vm.run_command("git clone ...")   full_vm.create_file("report.txt", content)   full_vm.zip(files)
