Configurable, whitelisted, enable/disable-able capabilities on any VM:
```
let vm = qai.connect_vm(
    sandboxed: true, language: "python",
    allow_network: false, allow_file_access: false, allow_subprocess: false,
    max_memory: "512MB", max_execution_time: "5s",
    allowed_imports: ["math","json"], allowed_packages: []
)
vm.enable("network")   vm.disable("file_access")   vm.current_permissions()
```
SQL-style operation feedback on every execution:
```
vm.run(code)
// → "Executed in 0.03s. Exit code: 0. Memory used: 12MB. Output: '42'. No errors."
vm.run(bad_code)
// → "Failed after 0.01s. [WHAT] SyntaxError on line 3  [WHY] Missing closing parenthesis  [FIX] Check line 3"
```
RAM-safe sequential training queue, avoiding concurrent training overload:
```
