```
Supporting ideas:
`vm.run(code, on_quota_exceeded: "kill_and_report")` — explicit behavior on hitting resource limits
`vm.detect_breakout_attempts()` — flags code specifically trying to exceed granted permissions
`vm.snapshot("clean_state")` / `.restore("clean_state")` — reset to known-good state between runs
`vm.run(code, max_output_size: "1MB")` — prevents runaway output from flooding memory/logs
`vm.audit_log()` — full timestamped record of everything ever run through this VM instance
