108. The Learning Curriculum (Finally Documented)
The framework's actual "learn it in about a week" path — previously only discussed, now recorded as the real reference:
Language basics — variables, functions, control flow, the `Time`/`System` utilities (Section 86)
Your first model — `build → train → chat`, zero theory
Seeing inside — `.visualize()`, `.explain()`, the dashboard
